The people is a list of 3, 2, 2, and 1.
The limit is 3.
Sort people.
The low is 0.
The high is the last position of people.
The boats is 0.
Repeat while low is at most high.
If low is high, add 1 to boats, set low to low plus 1, set high to high minus 1.
If low is less than high.
The pair is item low of people plus item high of people.
If pair is at most limit, add 1 to low.
Set high to high minus 1.
Add 1 to boats.

Show boats.
